     "description": "Prescribed: Sensible heat flux the PBL scheme receives: in WRF the slab land-surface scheme recomputes hfx from its own energy balance after sfclayrev, so pbl_driver sees the slab value (driver-level hfx_out), not sfclayrev's. Prescribed because the slab cannot be co-mounted (gap (n), see the document description)."
    },
